{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":34,"ref":"1-kings 22:34","book":"1-kings","lang":"de","chapter":22,"translation":"Und ein Mann spannte ⟨den⟩ Bogen aufs Geratewohl, und er traf ⟨את⟩ den König von Jisra'el zwischen ⟨den⟩ Gelenken und zwischen ⟨dem⟩ Panzer. Da sagte er zu seinem Wagenlenker: „Dreh deine Hand und bring mich aus ⟨dem⟩ Lager heraus, denn ich bin ⟨schwer⟩ verwundet.\"","tokens":[{"surface":"ואיש","gloss":"Und ein Mann"},{"surface":"משך","gloss":"spannte"},{"surface":"בקשת","gloss":"⟨den⟩ Bogen"},{"surface":"לתמו","gloss":"aufs Geratewohl"},{"surface":"ויכה","gloss":"und er traf"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"den König von Jisra'el"},{"surface":"מלך","gloss":"den König"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"von Jisra'el"},{"surface":"בין","gloss":"zwischen"},{"surface":"הדבקים","gloss":"⟨den⟩ Gelenken"},{"surface":"ובין","gloss":"und zwischen"},{"surface":"השרין","gloss":"⟨dem⟩ Panzer"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"Da sagte er"},{"surface":"לרכבו","gloss":"zu seinem Wagenlenker"},{"surface":"הפך","gloss":"Dreh"},{"surface":"ידך","gloss":"deine Hand"},{"surface":"והוציאני","gloss":"und bring mich heraus"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"aus"},{"surface":"המחנה","gloss":"⟨dem⟩ Lager"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"denn"},{"surface":"החליתי","gloss":"ich bin ⟨schwer⟩ verwundet"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-06T22:41:02.946525218Z","model":"glm-5.2"}